<subpara id="RM0000016A3012X_02" type-id="51" category="05" proc-id="RM0550J___0000B6700000">
<name>Inspection Procedure</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<atten4>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>When replacing the navigation receiver assembly on a vehicle not subscribed to the G-BOOK service, perform the vehicle linking setting. (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM000001C3S00RX"/>)</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>When replacing the navigation receiver assembly on a vehicle subscribed to the G-BOOK service, perform the vehicle linking setting, then perform the G-BOOK use resumption operation and HELPNET service start operation. (see <xref label="Seep02" href="RM000001C3S00RX"/>)</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>If the navigation receiver assembly is replaced while a purchased G-SOUND unlimited license exists, perform G-SOUND license recovery. (see <xref label="Seep03" href="RM000001C3S00RX"/>)</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</atten4>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM0000016A3012X_03" type-id="01" category="01">
<name>Procedure</name>
<testgrp id="RM0000016A3012X_03_0001" proc-id="RM0550J___0000B6800000">
<testtitle>Start Diagnosis</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<atten4>
<ptxt>(see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM0000002RV02BX"/>)</ptxt>
</atten4>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM0000016A3012X_03_0002" fin="false">NEXT</down>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM0000016A3012X_03_0002" proc-id="RM0550J___0000B6900000">
<testtitle>Microphone Check (Microphone Input Level)</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<test1>
<ptxt>Microphone Check (Microphone Input Level)</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="E122002" width="2.775699831in" height="2.775699831in"/>
</figure>
<test2>
<ptxt>Select "Navigation Check" on the diagnosis check menu screen to display the navigation check menu screen.</ptxt>
</test2>
<test2>
<ptxt>Select "Microphone &amp; Voice Recognition Check" on the Navigation &amp; Check Menu screen to display the microphone voice recognition check screen.</ptxt>
</test2>
<test2>
<ptxt>Speak into the microphone and inspect the display of the microphone input level gauge.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Specified Condition</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt>Microphone input level gauge moves</ptxt>
</specitem>
</spec>
</test2>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM0000016A3012X_03_0003" fin="false">OK</down>
<right ref="RM0000016A3012X_03_0004" fin="false">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM0000016A3012X_03_0003" proc-id="RM0550J___0000B6A00000">
<testtitle>Microphone Check (Recording and Playback of Spoken Voice)</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<test1>
<ptxt>Microphone Check (Recording and Playback of Spoken Voice)</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="E122002" width="2.775699831in" height="2.775699831in"/>
</figure>
<test2>
<ptxt>After pressing the record switch, speak into the microphone and record the voice.</ptxt>
</test2>
<test2>
<ptxt>Press the playback switch and check the recorded voice.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Specified Condition</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt>The spoken voice is played back normally without noise, distortion, etc.</ptxt>
</specitem>
</spec>
<atten4>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>During playback of the recorded voice, the microphone input level gauge does not respond to the playback sound.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>The content spoken during recording is optional.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Recording stops after 5 seconds elapse or when the stop switch is pressed.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>During recording and playback, all switch operations except the stop switch are disabled.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>When nothing has been recorded, the playback switch is grayed out.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Playback ends when playback of the recorded content is finished.</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</atten4>
</test2>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM0000016A3012X_03_0030" fin="false">OK</down>
<right ref="RM0000016A3012X_03_0004" fin="false">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM0000016A3012X_03_0030" proc-id="RM0550J___0000B6K00000">
<testtitle>Replace Cellular Phone</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<test1>
<ptxt>With the customer's permission, connect a staff member's Bluetooth compatible cellular phone.</ptxt>
<atten4>
<ptxt>Following the owner's manual, register and connect the Bluetooth cellular phone.</ptxt>
</atten4>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Check that a call can be made.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Result</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.07in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="2.06in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Calls cannot be made normally</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Calls can be made normally</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
<atten4>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>If there is a problem with the cellular phone, contact the customer and ask them to have the cellular phone checked.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>After the inspection is complete, delete the registered cellular phone and the history of telephone numbers used for the inspection.</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</atten4>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM0000016A3012X_03_0010" fin="true">A</down>
<right ref="RM0000016A3012X_03_0031" fin="true">B</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM0000016A3012X_03_0010">
<testtitle>Replace Navigation Receiver Assembly<xref label="Seep01" href="RM000001XG4006X"/>
</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM0000016A3012X_03_0004" proc-id="RM0550J___0000B6B00000">
<testtitle>Inspect Navigation Receiver Assembly (Microphone Power Source, Ground)</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Pre-inspection Preparation</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="E147224J01" width="2.775699831in" height="2.775699831in"/>
</figure>
<test2>
<ptxt>Disconnect the map light or interior illumination light assembly No.1 connector.</ptxt>
</test2>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Voltage Inspection</ptxt>
<test2>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the voltage between the navigation receiver assembly side connector terminal and body ground.</ptxt>
<atten4>
<ptxt>Measure from the back side of the connector with navigation receiver assembly connector H connected.</ptxt>
</atten4>
<spec>
<title>Voltage</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt/>
</specitem>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3" align="left">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.99in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.14in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="1.00in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Inspection Terminal (Terminal Name)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>H17 (MACC) - Body ground</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>ACC ON</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>5 V</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test2>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Resistance Inspection</ptxt>
<test2>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the resistance between each terminal of the navigation receiver assembly connector and body ground.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Resistance</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt/>
</specitem>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3" align="left">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.99in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.14in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="1.00in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Inspection Terminal (Terminal Name)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>H12 (TSW-) - Body ground</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Below 1 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>H20 (MIC-) - Body ground</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Below 1 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test2>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM0000016A3012X_03_0024" fin="false">OK</down>
<right ref="RM0000016A3012X_03_0015" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
